.IX Item "cksum"
cksum FILE...
.Sp
Calculate CRC32 checksum of FILEs
.IP \fBclear\fR 4
.IX Item "clear"
clear
.Sp
Clear screen
.IP \fBcmp\fR 4
.IX Item "cmp"
cmp [\-ls] [\-n NUM] FILE1 [FILE2]
.Sp
Compare FILE1 with FILE2 (or stdin)
.Sp
.Vb 4
\&        \-l      Write the byte numbers (decimal) and values (octal)
\&                for all differing bytes
\&        \-s      Quiet
